DataCat Agent: third-party notices
==================================

The DataCat Agent is a distribution of the OpenTelemetry Collector built with the OpenTelemetry Collector Builder.
DataCat's own code is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The binary also contains the Go modules listed
below, each under its own license; their license and notice files follow, as shipped with each module.

Modules under the Mozilla Public License 2.0 (github.com/hashicorp/*) are included unmodified. Their source code is
available from each module's repository at the version listed, and through the Go module proxy
(https://proxy.golang.org).

